        "original_id": "ea60f1c7-44a6-56a2-b04f-3fc7c5a51d92",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Suresh Peters, S.P. Venkatesh\n- Songs: Chikku Bukku Rayile, Style\n- Films: Gentleman, Punjabi House, Chup Chup Ke, Khatta Meetha\n- Topics: Indian film music, adaptation, film debut\n\nFacts:\n- The song \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" is a Tamil song featured in the 1993 Tamil film \"Gentleman\".\n- Suresh Peters is an Indian film music director and playback rapper/singer whose notable songs include \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" from \"Gentleman\" and \"Style\".\n- In the 1998 Malayalam film \"Punjabi House\", Suresh Peters composed the songs in his debut as a film composer, while S.P. Venkatesh composed the score.\n- The film \"Chup Chup Ke\" was originally titled \"Khatta Meetha\" and its story was adapted from the 1998 Malayalam film \"Punjabi House\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
